
@startuml

|Member|
start
:Bring back a copy;

|System|
:Close the loan;

if (Return is late?) then (yes)
    :Activate extension point late return;
    :Suspend the member;
endif

if (Book reserved?) then (yes)
    :Keep the copy aside;
    :Notify the member who reserved it;
endif

stop

@enduml
